Description: GPU-accelerated voice-to-text daemon (Python/faster-whisper)
 AutoWhisper is a high-performance, background daemon that converts
 speech to text using NVIDIA GPU acceleration and faster-whisper with
 distil-large-v3 model.
 .
 Features:
  * Sub-200ms latency with GPU acceleration
  * Zero UI - runs as background daemon
  * Hotkey triggered (customizable)
  * Audio feedback with beeps
  * Direct text injection to any window
  * 100% offline operation
  * Optimized for NVIDIA RTX GPUs
 .
 This package includes the daemon and systemd service integration.
 Whisper models are automatically downloaded on first use via faster-whisper.
